# Packagist serves a git archive, so what is NOT export-ignored here is
# what every consumer downloads.
#
# `.github/` workflows only ever run in this repository, and
# `package-lock.json` pins an npm tree for the asset build -- neither is
# reachable or usable from the other side of `composer require`. Together
# they were 0.11 MB of a 0.25 MB archive.
#
# Tests are deliberately NOT excluded here: that is an estate-wide
# convention question, not this package s to answer alone.
.github/          export-ignore
package-lock.json export-ignore
.gitattributes    export-ignore
